* SPICE Netlist

* Voltage Sources
V1 8 0 DC V+
V2 0 6 DC V-

* Current Source
IREF 8 1 DC IREF

* Resistor
R1 8 2 R1_VALUE

* Transistors
Q1 1 2 6 NPN
Q2 3 4 6 NPN

* Connections
VBE 4 6 DC VBE

* Nodes
* 1: Collector of Q1
* 2: Base of Q1, one side of R1
* 3: Collector of Q2, output voltage
* 4: Base of Q2
* 6: Emitters of Q1 and Q2, V-
* 8: V+ and IREF connection